---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { names, lengths } from '../../lib/loom/model';
import { presets } from '../../lib/loom/presets';
import '../../styles/loom.css';
---
<Layout title="Sound Loom — a little rhythm, woven by you" description="A local electronic music studio. Weave six voices, explore repeating rhythms, and take your music with you.">
  <section class="loom wrap" id="loom">
    <header class="loom-heading"><div><a href="/studio/" class="loom-back">← CREATE / SMALL INSTRUMENTS</a><h1>Sound <em>Loom.</em></h1><p>Six threads. A rhythm of your own.</p></div><span class="loom-edition">ELECTRONIC STUDY / 002<br/>COMPOSE · LISTEN · KEEP</span></header>
    <noscript>Enable JavaScript to compose locally. This page never starts audio automatically.</noscript>
    <div class="loom-start"><label>Starting point <select id="loom-preset">{presets.map((p,i)=><option value={i}>{p.name}</option>)}<option value="blank">Blank weave</option></select></label><button id="loom-new">Load / new</button><span>Made here. Kept here. No uploads.</span></div>
    <p id="loom-status" class="loom-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready to compose. Sound starts only when you press Play.</p>
    <div class="loom-workspace">
      <div class="loom-main">
        <div class="loom-transport"><button id="loom-play" class="loom-primary">Play ▶</button><button id="loom-stop">Stop ■</button><button id="loom-restart">Restart ↺</button><span id="loom-position">STEP 01</span><span id="loom-pending" hidden>Changes at the next bar</span></div>
        <div class="loom-stage"><canvas id="loom-canvas" aria-label="Six woven sound tracks. Use the accessible track selectors and note grid below to edit."></canvas></div>
        <div class="loom-score-heading"><div><span class="loom-eyebrow">THE SCORE</span><h2>A place for every note.</h2></div><div><button id="loom-undo">Undo</button><button id="loom-redo">Redo</button></div></div>
        <div class="loom-track-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Select a track">{names.map((name,i)=><button data-track={i} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}><span>0{i+1}</span>{name}</button>)}</div>
        <div class="loom-grid-wrap"><div id="loom-grid" class="loom-grid" aria-label="Note sequencer"></div></div>
        <p class="loom-help">Click a step to toggle it. Arrow keys move focus; Enter toggles. Space plays / pauses in the score. Locked notes survive generation.</p>
        <div class="loom-generators"><label>Density <input id="loom-density" type="number" min="0" max="32" value="4"/></label><label>Rotate <input id="loom-rotation" type="number" min="0" max="31" value="0"/></label><button id="loom-generate">Generate this track</button><button id="loom-variation">New seed / variation</button><button id="loom-clear">Clear unlocked</button></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="loom-controls">
        <section><div class="loom-section-title"><h2>The shared pulse</h2><span id="loom-cycle">16 STEPS</span></div><div class="loom-pair"><label>Tempo / BPM <input id="loom-bpm" type="number" min="60" max="160" value="96"/></label><label>Swing / % <input id="loom-swing" type="number" min="50" max="65" value="56"/></label></div><div class="loom-pair"><label>Root <select id="loom-root">{['C','C♯','D','D♯','E','F','F♯','G','G♯','A','A♯','B'].map((n,i)=><option value={i}>{n}</option>)}</select></label><label>Scale <select id="loom-scale"><option value="minor">Minor pentatonic</option><option value="major">Major pentatonic</option><option value="dorian">Dorian</option></select></label></div><label>Seed <input id="loom-seed" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" value="17"/></label></section>
        <section><div class="loom-section-title"><h2 id="loom-track-name">Soft kick</h2><span>TRACK</span></div><label>Track length <select id="loom-length">{lengths.map(n=><option value={n} selected={n===16}>{n} steps</option>)}</select></label><label>Volume <output id="loom-volume-value"></output><input id="loom-volume" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01"/></label><label>Pan <output id="loom-pan-value"></output><input id="loom-pan" type="range" min="-1" max="1" step="0.01"/></label><label>Space / warm echo <output id="loom-space-value"></output><input id="loom-space" type="range" min="0" max="0.6" step="0.01"/></label><div class="loom-toggle-pair"><button id="loom-mute" aria-pressed="false">Mute</button><button id="loom-solo" aria-pressed="false">Solo</button></div></section>
        <section><div class="loom-section-title"><h2>Selected note</h2><span id="loom-note-name">STEP 01</span></div><label>Velocity <output id="loom-velocity-value"></output><input id="loom-velocity" type="range" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.05"/></label><label>Probability <output id="loom-probability-value"></output><input id="loom-probability" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05"/></label><label id="loom-pitch-label">Scale degree <select id="loom-degree">{Array.from({length:14},(_,i)=><option value={i}>{i+1}</option>)}</select></label><label class="loom-checkbox"><input id="loom-locked" type="checkbox"/> Keep during generation</label></section>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <section class="loom-keep"><div><span class="loom-eyebrow">TAKE THE THREAD WITH YOU</span><h2>Keep this little rhythm<span>.</span></h2><p class="loom-help">Save a new local copy, or export an editable project. WAV includes two seconds of echo tail — not a seamless loop.</p></div><div class="loom-save-controls"><label class="sr-only" for="loom-name">Project name</label><input id="loom-name" maxlength="80" value="01 / Soft machinery"/><button id="loom-save" class="loom-primary">Save new copy</button><button id="loom-export">Export project</button><button id="loom-import">Import project</button><input id="loom-file" type="file" accept=".json,.loom.json" hidden/><label>WAV <select id="loom-cycles"><option value="1">1 full cycle</option><option value="2">2 full cycles</option><option value="4">4 full cycles</option></select></label><button id="loom-wav">Export WAV ↗</button><span id="loom-duration" class="loom-help"></span><span id="loom-dirty" class="loom-help">Not saved on this device</span></div></section>
    <section class="loom-library"><div class="loom-eyebrow">YOUR SOUND STUDIES</div><h2>Pick up a thread<span>.</span></h2><div id="loom-library" class="loom-saves"></div></section>
    <details class="loom-notes"><summary>How the loom keeps time</summary><p>Every step is a sixteenth note. Tracks can have different lengths; a full cycle ends when all six tracks meet again. Probability repeats for a given seed and cycle position. Generate uses evenly distributed Euclidean rhythms and notes within the selected scale; locked notes are preserved.</p><p>Edits during playback take effect together at the next bar, restarting the updated score at step one. Volume, pan, echo, mute and solo respond immediately. Pause preserves the next step; Stop returns to the beginning. Hidden tabs pause and never automatically resume.</p><p>All six instruments are synthesized on your device. No microphone, samples, account or uploads. WAV renders 44.1 kHz stereo PCM, up to 98 seconds including its tail. Different browsers may render subtle sonic differences. Use a comfortable listening volume.</p><p>Editable files are limited to 128 KB. Local saves are new copies, never overwrites. Your Living Canvas and Kinetic Workshop libraries remain separate. Sound unavailable? You can still edit and export the score.</p></details>
  </section>
  <script>import '../../scripts/loom';</script>
</Layout>
